<title>USA: HUBCO sets stock div, raises cash div.</title>
<headline>HUBCO sets stock div, raises cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MAHWAH, N.J. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>HUBCO Inc said on Thursday it had raised its quarterly cash dividend to $0.19 per share from $0.17 and declared a three percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock dividend is payable November 15, record November 4.</p>
<p>The cash dividend is payable December 2, record November 18.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
